Importance of Git/GitHub in DevOps-
•Git is a distributed version control system, and GitHub is a web-based hosting platform for Git repositories.
•In the DevOps world, Git acts as the core source code management tool, enabling collaboration, version control, CI/CD triggers, rollback, and more.

🔄Where Git Fits in the DevOps Lifecycle ❓ 
